{"id":17287685760,"name":"[🔥EVENT🔥] Omega Rune Incremental","desc":"Welcome to Omega Rune Incremental!\nIn this game your objective is to open Runes that boost your Money and Rebirth and Upgrade your way to the top!\n\nHow to play:\n💰Collect Money\n🍀Open Runes to boost Money\n♻️Rebirth to boost your Money even more\n🔮Collect Crystals that save on Rebirth\n🍀Find Secret and Omega Rarity Runes that save on Rebirth\n💎Buy Upgrades and collect Rewards to boost your Luck\n🥇Become the richest player and top the leaderboards!\n\nPatriot event is now live! Enjoy a sale as well!\n\nUpdate 5, v3.0.0\nFind full changelogs on our communications server.\nSome highlights include:\n-New Volcano World\n-New Reset Layer\n\nPremium Benefits\n\n- Premium users gain 1.2x More luck!\n\n📌Like & Favourite the game and join our Group for +1 Rune Bulk!\nhttps://www.roblox.com/groups/34005746/Bruces-Creations\n\n📌Join our Communications server for +2 Luck!","path":"/game/17287685760-event-omega-rune-incremental","slug":"17287685760-event-omega-rune-incremental","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-4a4fe2c6c1b3c2418c3de8b3ea4da879/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/45919fe4a1e08a134bf56702ddf8161f/150/150/Image/Jpeg","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":0,"visitor":380426,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-07-04T08:58:28.187Z","creator":{"name":"Bruces Creations","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"EVENT-Omega-Rune-Incremental-Max-Friend-Boost-15230","_id":"668664346dce70d9a154d46a","title":"Max Friend Boost","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c78352","gameId":17287685760,"name":"[🔥EVENT🔥] Omega Rune Incremental","imageUrl":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/45919fe4a1e08a134bf56702ddf8161f/500/280/Image/Jpeg","placeId":17287685760},"features":"- Get Max Friend Boost","tags":[],"script":"-- DOESN'T WORK ON SOLARA\nOldnamecall = hookmetamethod(game, \"__namecall\", function(self, ...)\n\tlocal